Scope of licensing in this repository
=====================================

PATCHES  (patches/<package>/<version>/*.patch)
    Each patch is a modification of the package named in its path and is a derivative work of it,
    so each carries THAT package's licence rather than one chosen here.  This is what allows a
    patch to be offered upstream unchanged.  Everything currently present patches GCC or binutils,
    both GPL-3.0-or-later, so LICENSE governs all of them today — but read a patch's own header
    rather than assuming that stays true.

DOCUMENTATION AND BUILD RECIPES  (README.md, docs/, build/, this file)
    Original work, offered under GPL-3.0-or-later.  docs/gotchas.md is the canonical record of what
    breaks on HP-UX 11.23 and why; it is deliberately not duplicated into the sibling repositories,
    which link to it instead.

LICENSE
    Verbatim GNU General Public License version 3.

BINARIES
    The depots built from these recipes are not in git — they are attached to tagged releases.
    Each one ships the corresponding source alongside the binaries, as the GPL requires.
